# Traefik safety

## Read-only default

List routers, services, and middlewares are fine when Traefik work is
authorized. Do **not**:

- delete a router, service, or middleware
- expose an entrypoint without TLS when the user did not ask
- remove auth / IPAllowList middlewares that protect a route
- point a production host at a guessed upstream

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Prefer update-in-place. Never paste dashboard credentials or ACME account
secrets into chat.
